%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 166a482e3eae72c489a6ff4d8076c561, type: 3}
  m_Name: DwiMountain!
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  npcDisplayName: <color=#6af7b8>Dwi</color>.
  playerDisplayName: <color=#f5c071>Kylie</color>.
  voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: So like-
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1ad88008a6af75b4dacb4199e6493588, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: Yeah this..
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 76b54b6e64aa47c42873416ccae0d2da, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: This isn't supposed to be here yet
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 76b54b6e64aa47c42873416ccae0d2da, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    text: What do you mean by that
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b37ffeaa2e8ad648843c8cd7c1465b4, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: Well the sequence of the game was initially intended to be that the player
      must meet me first before unlocking the jump pad
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 76b54b6e64aa47c42873416ccae0d2da, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: Like, the player, or, you actually, come across this big gap and think
      "I couldn't possibly go across that"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 76b54b6e64aa47c42873416ccae0d2da, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: And then you'll look around and meet me again in a nearby area
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 76b54b6e64aa47c42873416ccae0d2da, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: And THEN i offer help by making these jump pads and placing these across
      the map
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 76b54b6e64aa47c42873416ccae0d2da, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: But
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 76b54b6e64aa47c42873416ccae0d2da, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: It seems the developer of the game either got lazy or got no time to implement
      that yet
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 76b54b6e64aa47c42873416ccae0d2da, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    text: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b37ffeaa2e8ad648843c8cd7c1465b4, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Amzing gameplay
    portrait: {fileID: -3495242124985409963, guid: 00e9cd031d3f399439c82a084920ef05, type: 3}
